    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/broadcast-lite/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Broadcast is a sleek and lightweight WordPress theme crafted specifically for streamers and content creators. Designed to seamlessly integrate with Twitch, YouTube, and Kick, Broadcast provides the tools you need to showcase your streams, videos, and gaming content in style. Whether you’re building a personal streaming site or a professional hub for your brand, Broadcast offers a clean and modern design that’s easy to customize. The theme is optimized for use with other StreamWeasels plugins, including StreamWeasels Twitch Integration, Kick Integration, YouTube Integration, and Online Status Bar. These plugins work together to bring your streaming services to life, allowing you to display live streams, channel information, schedules, and more—effortlessly connecting your audience with your content. Broadcast is the perfect foundation for gamers, streamers, and content creators looking to build an engaging, professional website that supports their streaming journey."
    },
